.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-BCACHE 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-bcache
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's bcache plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP bcache
\fBplugin\fP bcache {
    \fBfilter\fP {
        ...
    }
}
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBbcache\fP plugin collect statistics from the block layer cache Bcache.
The \fBbcache\fP plugin supports the following options:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \fBfilter\fP
Configure a filter to modify or drop the metrics.
See \fBFILTER CONFIGURATION\fP in
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
